<article class="env-lemma" id="047P">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/047P">Lemma <span data-tag="047P">39.8.4</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a perfect field of characteristic $p > 0$ (see Lemma <a href="/tag/047N" data-tag="047N">39.8.2</a> for the characteristic zero case). Let $G$ be a locally algebraic group scheme over $k$. If $G$ is reduced then the structure morphism $G \to \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(k)$ is smooth, i.e., $G$ is a smooth group scheme. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      By Lemma <a href="/tag/047I" data-tag="047I">39.6.3</a> the sheaf $\Omega _{G/k}$ is free. Hence the lemma follows from Varieties, Lemma <a href="/tag/04QP" data-tag="04QP">33.25.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>